eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445620/extras/ce573a655859e8921029031c40264568.webm?t=1744307822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445620/extras/ce573a655859e8921029031c40264568.mp4?t=1744307822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a common visitor in this world, but don't worry; in <strong>Normal</strong> mode, checkpoints offer a relative sense of safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, <strong>Hostile</strong> mode is strictly for those who want to hurt themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445620/extras/088cb03bcb48aaeb368ffbf2be7c2d8f.webp?t=1744307822\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445620/extras/4eca4d9402ea6f202b5c834a46aec4b6.poster.avif?t=1744307822\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445620/extras/4eca4d9402ea6f202b5c834a46aec4b6.webm?t=1744307822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445620/extras/4eca4d9402ea6f202b5c834a46aec4b6.mp4?t=1744307822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The key to survival is patience, learning, and executing precise jumps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Are you ready to face Hostile Dreams 2 and push beyond your limits?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>*This game is not a direct sequel but the successor to the first one, so prior knowledge of it is not required.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im